@startuml
title RAN Agent Simulation — 安全执行状态机

hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam ArrowColor #4263EB
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EEF4FF
  BorderColor #4263EB
  FontColor #172033
  StartColor #2F9E60
  EndColor #64748B
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7E8
  BorderColor #E09F3E
  FontColor #172033
}

state "已接收\nINTENT_RECEIVED" as Received
state "快照就绪" as SnapshotReady
state "决策中\nRules 或 Pi + 0.8B" as Deciding
state "动作已提出" as Proposed
state "计划已验证" as PlanValidated
state "执行中" as Dispatching
state "已确认\nACTION_ACK" as Acked #ECFDF3
state "安全空操作\nSAFE_NOOP" as SafeNoop #FFF7E8
state "已拒绝\nREJECTED" as Rejected #FFF1F2
state "效果观察（规划）\nT_effect" as Observing
state "完成 / 回滚" as Finished #ECFDF3

[*] --> Received

Received --> Rejected : Schema / 有效期 / 重放 / 预算无效
Received --> SnapshotReady : Intent 校验并占用成功

SnapshotReady --> Rejected : 遥测缺失、陈旧或约束不满足
SnapshotReady --> Deciding : 输入受限上下文与候选工具

Deciding --> Proposed : 恰好一个 proposal
Deciding --> SafeNoop : 推理超时、取消或无输出

Proposed --> Rejected : 动作未授权、目标越界、参数非法
Proposed --> PlanValidated : 确定性校验通过

PlanValidated --> SafeNoop : dispatch 前已到截止时间
PlanValidated --> Dispatching : 仍有执行预算

Dispatching --> Acked : 截止前提交并收到 ACK
Dispatching --> SafeNoop : 执行超时或取消
Dispatching --> Rejected : 版本冲突或前置条件失败

Acked --> Observing : 进入独立 KPI 窗口
Observing --> Finished : 目标满足
Observing --> Finished : 回滚 / 安全恢复

SafeNoop --> [*] : safe_timeout
Rejected --> [*] : rejected
Finished --> [*]

note right of SafeNoop
超时会撤销执行资格；
迟到模型结果不得重新进入 dispatch。
end note

note right of Deciding
规则与模型是可比较的决策器，
并非默认自动降级关系。
end note

note bottom of Acked
ACK 是控制确认，不等于 KPI 已生效；
效果验证使用独立的 T_effect。
end note
@enduml
